<title>USA: Kaman Corp Q1 oper EPS $0.25 vs EPS $0.23.</title>
<headline>Kaman Corp Q1 oper EPS $0.25 vs EPS $0.23.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD, Conn. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>KAMAN CORPORATION AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		    (In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						     For the Three Months</p>
<p>							    Ended March 31,</p>
<p>								1997     1996</p>
<p> Revenues					     $252,157 $240,033</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>	Cost of sales				  189,069  177,464</p>
<p>Selling, general and administrative expense</p>
<p>							    51,033   51,013</p>
<p>	 Loss on closure of amplifier business   15,000	 --</p>
<p>	Interest expense				 2,479    2,429</p>
