<p> Income taxes (benefit)				(667)    3,770</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)				 (4,407)    5,202</p>
<p>Net earnings (loss) per common share:</p>
<p>	Primary					    (.28)	.23</p>
<p>	Fully diluted				    (.28)	.22</p>
