<p>NOTE: Operating earnings for the 1997 quarter, which exclude the $15 million charge for the closing of the Trace Elliot amplifier manufacturing plant, were a profit of $5.7 million, or $0.25 per share on a primary basis,  $0.24 per share fully-diluted.</p>
